# "a primeira semana de 2026" is ISO 8601 week 01 of that year: "The ISO
# 8601 definition for calendar week 01 is the week with the first Thursday
# of the Gregorian year"; equivalently "It has 4 January in it" (Wikipedia,
# "ISO week date").  "a última semana de 2026" is the year's last ISO week,
# for which the same page gives "It has 28 December in it".  The weeks of a
# month have no ISO definition and keep their own reading (the first Monday
# on or after the 1st).
semana
semanas
